  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">WFP humanitarian action in Palestine 2023-2024</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This allocation comes as a response to the updated UN flash appeal for US$ 1.2 billion for activities responding to the humanitarian needs caused by the armed conflict affecting Palestine.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This allocation contributes to WFP&#x2019;s activities responding to the humanitarian needs caused by the armed conflict affecting the Occupied Palestinian Territory. The flash appeal aims at reaching the 2.3 million people most in need of acute food assistance in Gaza and the West Bank. 

Due to its nature as a response to a humanitarian appeal operational results are general and highly aggregated and the MFA contribution is thus reflected in the overall results reporting by the partner. Please refer to this hyperlink: https://www.wfp.org/publications</narrative>
  </description>
